<Mod id="e4f857ba-faef-4c49-a215-2f63a2a116d7" version="3">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Chinese New Year Wonder Pack</Name>
    <Teaser>Gong Xi Fa Cai! Happy Chinese New Year everyone! To celebrate, here are five Chinese wonders to join your game!</Teaser>
    <Description>Gong Xi Fa Cai! Happy Chinese New Year everyone! To celebrate, here are five Chinese wonders to join your game! Gulou, a Drum Tower buillt in Beijing by during the reign of Kublai Khan; Jiayuguan Fort, the westernmost and Most intact pass of the Great Wall; Shanghai World Financial Center, a marvel of engineering; Xuankong Si, a temple built in the side of a cliff; and the Yellow Crane Tower, one of the four great towers of China.</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai, sukritact</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Moriboe, Ambrox62</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
